---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "@/data/site";
import CTA from "@/components/sections/CTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Chat Editor — Edit Video by Prompt"
  description="Direct your AI co-editor with plain English. Cut, split, swap captions, generate b-roll, regenerate visuals — describe the edit and Viona performs it."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-xs font-medium text-primary mb-4">Feature</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6">
        AI Chat Editor
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Viona's AI chat editor lets you direct every edit in plain English. Instead of dragging
        clips on a timeline, you describe what you want — "cut the first 30 seconds", "make this
        caption yellow", "add a bar chart when I mention the three metrics", "regenerate this
        scene in a cinematic style" — and the editor performs it. It's the fastest way to turn
        raw footage into a polished video.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">What you can prompt</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Viona understands both structural edits and creative direction. Structural prompts
          handle the mechanics: cut a range, split a clip, reorder scenes, remove silence, strip
          filler words, change the aspect ratio. Creative prompts reshape the content: swap
          caption presets, change color palettes, regenerate a specific visual with a different
          layout, apply a cinematic look, or ask for a tighter opening.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          You can chain prompts too. Ask to cut the intro, then ask for MrBeast-style captions,
          then ask for an animated flowchart when you explain your three-step process. Each
          prompt stacks on top of the previous edit, and Viona keeps the project consistent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">How it works under the hood</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Viona transcribes your video at the word level, then builds a semantic model of the
          scenes — what you're saying, what you're showing, and where the natural beats fall.
          When you prompt an edit, the AI maps your instruction to concrete timeline operations:
          which frames to cut, which assets to swap, which scenes to regenerate. You review the
          change and accept or ask for something different.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Nothing is one-shot. Every edit is reviewable, reversible, and refinable. The AI is
          your co-editor, not a black box.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Who this is for</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Anyone who would rather describe an edit than perform it. Creators publishing to
          YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, or LinkedIn. Marketers producing product and launch
          videos at volume. Educators and consultants turning recordings into polished lessons.
          Agencies that need to ship 30 edits a week without burning out an editor.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Related features</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href="/features/caption-templates/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Animated caption templates</a> — 20+ subtitle styles, all promptable.</li>
          <li><a href="/features/ai-visuals/" class="text-primary hover:underline">AI visual generation</a> — auto-generated charts synced to your narration.</li>
          <li><a href="/pricing/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Pricing</a> — free to try, no card required.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <a href={siteConfig.appUrl} class="btn-primary inline-flex justify-center">Try the AI chat editor</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
